    "group": "Vortex Missile Strongpoint",
    "summary": "In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), whenever this model targets a unit with its vortex missile battery:\n\n- roll a D6 for that unit and a D6 for each other enemy unit up to 3\" from it; the vortex strikes each unit that rolls a 4+\n- after this model resolves all its attacks against the target, each unit the vortex struck takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**",
